From freebsd-alpha  Sun Nov 14 20:12:01 1999
From: "Kenneth D. Merry" <ken () kdm ! org>
Date: Sun, 14 Nov 1999 20:12:01 +0000
To: freebsd-alpha
Subject: Re: AlphaPC post-install BOOT - how?
